# Canonical author identity.
#
# git reads this for log, shortlog, blame and the GitHub contributor list, so the history
# presents one author without rewriting a single commit - no SHA changes, no broken clones
# or references. Early commits were authored under a personal address and a bare handle;
# both are mapped to the institutional identity used from 2026-10 onward.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> <other@email>
# The first line with no second address sets the canonical NAME for that address.

Marc-Olivier Duceppe <marc-olivier.duceppe@inspection.gc.ca>
Marc-Olivier Duceppe <marc-olivier.duceppe@inspection.gc.ca> <marc-olivier.duceppe@inspection.gc.ca>
Marc-Olivier Duceppe <marc-olivier.duceppe@inspection.gc.ca> <marc-olivier.duceppe@inspection.gc.ca>
